2026-10-31T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2365) 'Recording and delivery
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2365  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-31T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2365) 'It is recorded as `.cfhd` through &{repo("contract-cineform-movie-writer")} at double precision and delivered by &{repo("interactor-av1mkv")}'s `deliver.exs`, which writes only those two files. No master is MJPEG. Nothing records through the encoder BLOCKLIST.md bars or through the desktop driver's own recorder: recordings are CineForm, the live stream is PyroWave, and the headset view comes from the compositor mirror.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2365  1 LINE
 Text:Written

